            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Kmscon is a simple terminal emulator based on linux kernel mode setting (KMS). It is an attempt to replace the in-kernel VT implementation with a userspace console\n\nThis is probably just a missing condition in `augment_terminfo`, or `terminfo_is_term_family`, or we need to update `terminfo_builtin.h`. That assumes your system terminfo is correct.\n\nNeed a fix from someone who uses kmscon.",
