            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Confirmed it by testing a local terminfo version with Ss and Se added like this:\n\n```\nmkdir -p $HOME/.local/share/terminfo\ninfocmp kmscon > kmscon.ti\n\n# add Ss and Se\nprintf '        Ss=\\\\E[%%p1%%d q,\\n        Se=\\\\E[0 q,' >> kmscon.ti\n\n# compile *.ti file\ntic -x -o \"$HOME/.local/share/terminfo\" kmscon.ti\n\n# run neovim using local terminfo version that has new data for kmscon\nTERMINFO=\"$HOME/.local/share/terminfo\" nvim\n```\n\nCursor change works with that.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-13T22:18:40Z",
